charted-realms/consequences-attraction-2013-10-07#:~:text=Until%20the%20time%20when,That%20had%20broken%20her.","citation":{"source":"wizards-archive","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Consequences of Attraction","series":"Uncharted Realms","authors":[],"date":"2013-10-07","url":"http://magic.wizards.com:80/en/articles/archive/uncharted-realms/consequences-attraction-2013-10-07","link":"https://web.archive.org/web/20150920030410/http://magic.wizards.com:80/en/articles/archive/uncharted-realms/consequences-attraction-2013-10-07#:~:text=Until%20the%20time%20when,That%20had%20broken%20her.","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20150920030410/http://magic.wizards.com:80/en/articles/archive/uncharted-realms/consequences-attraction-2013-10-07","license":null,"text":"\"The Consequences of Attraction\". Uncharted Realms, Wizards of the Coast, 7 Oct 2013. Archived by the Internet Archive."}},{"id":"uncharted-realms-consequences-attraction-2013-10-07-e13","era":null,"summary":"Xandria finds a survivor on her beach, Tolios, and nurses him tenderly.","participants":["xandria","tolios"],"location":"the-siren-sea","importance":"major","page":"archive/uncharted-realms-consequences-attraction-2013-10-07","order":413,"story_date":"2013-10-07","storyline":"Theros","source":"wizards-archive","paragraph":49,"quote":"She turned him over, gingerly, with softness and care.","link":"https://web.archive.org/web/20150920030410/http://magic.wizards.com:80/en/articles/archive/uncharted-realms/consequences-attraction-2013-10-07#:~:text=She%20turned%20him%20over%2C,with%20softness%20and%20care.","citation":{"source":"wizards-archive","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Consequences of Attraction","series":"Uncharted Realms","authors":[],"date":"2013-10-07","url":"http://magic.wizards.com:80/en/articles/archive/uncharted-realms/consequences-attraction-2013-10-07","link":"https://web.archive.org/web/20150920030410/http://magic.wizards.com: